{"id":"d_counseling_mana_02","cat":"counsel","group":{"id":"char1019","label":"Mana"},"label":"Advising Mana: 02","stage":null,"prev":"d_counseling_mana_01","next":"d_counseling_mana_03","speakers":{"mana":"Mana"},"icons":{"mana":"si_c290_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_counseling_mana_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_mana_02_1","text":"They say that everyone has their secrets,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CommanderRoom","bgArt":"commanderroom","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_backtonormal","movie":null,"shown":["mana"],"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_mana_02_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_mana_02_2","text":"but it's rare to find someone with many secrets.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_mana_02_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_mana_02_3","text":"Commander, what are your thoughts on people who have a lot of secrets?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_mana_02_4","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_mana_02_4","text":"It can be quite difficult to befriend such people.","jump":"d_counseling_mana_02_6","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_100"},{"id":"d_counseling_mana_02_5","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_mana_02_5","text":"I don't feel the need to know all of someone's secrets.","jump":"d_counseling_mana_02_9","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_120"},{"id":"d_counseling_mana_02_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_mana_02_6","text":"... I see.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_mana_02_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_mana_02_7","text":"I don't think it's necessary to know every last secret to get close to someone.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_mana_02_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_mana_02_8","text":"There are many ways to build relationships with people in this world.","jump":"d_counseling_mana_02_13","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_mana_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_mana_02_9","text":"It seems we think alike.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_mana_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_mana_02_10","text":"I, too, believe there's no need to know all of someone else's secrets, nor to reveal all of your own.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_mana_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_mana_02_11","text":"Also, the more of someone's secrets that you know,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_mana_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_mana_02_12","text":"the more burdens you'll have to bear, and all it does is make you think more deeply.","jump":"d_counseling_mana_02_13","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_mana_02_13","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_mana_02_13","text":"Mana and I talk about secrets.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"none","bgArt":"none","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"}]}